 "short_name": "Mamusa",
 "_doc": "Mamusa LM (Schweizer-Reneke). eMunsoft 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT' (header labels glued: 'Account Date: dd MON yyyyAccount Number: n'), METER READINGS with OLD / NEW / flag / CONSUMPTION / LEVIED AMOUNT / READING DATES, and ACCOUNT DETAILS 'DATE CODE DESCRIPTION UNITS@ TARIFF * VALUE'. Most PDFs hold SEVERAL monthly statements back to back (up to 6); the electricity section is an overlay from the first METER READINGS to the first REMITTANCE ADVICE and every summed rule is section-scoped, so each file yields its FIRST statement only. Codes: 011007 'KVA (BINNE) ELECTRICITY' = energy kWh (standard), 012007 KVA = demand, 010004 basic; DN/CN journal lines on electricity codes (and 000002 'DN BASIC ELECTR') go to other_r with the basic charge. Readings only when the table has a single kWh row; consumption/levied summed over rows. Bill-side anomalies kept as printed: Jul-2025 bills 1 kWh at the kVA rate; Oct-2025 bills a meter change as 480 555 kWh. Water/sewer/refuse/rates rows not built (multi-statement files). Fingerprint: own VAT number + masthead. IDENTITY mam_levied_identity_r = meter-table levied kWh + levied kVA + basic/journals, vs ledger energy + demand + basic/journals: 0.00 on 10/10, 0 checks.",
